OL,3,A'If you want the rainbow, you gotta put
OL,4,Aup with the rain': The wit and wisdom
OL,5,Aof Dolly Parton
OL,6,
OL,7,FDolly Parton, the much-loved US
OL,8,Fsinger-songwriter who has died at the
OL,9,Fage of 80, was known for her pearls of
OL,10,Fwisdom and humour as well as her music.
OL,12,FShe regularly offered her perceptive
OL,13,Fand witty insights about life, music,
OL,14,Ffame and equal rights.
OL,16,FHere are some of her most memorable
OL,17,Fquotes from down the years:
OL,19,F"The way I see it, if you want the
OL,20,Frainbow, you gotta put up with the
OL,21,Frain."
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
